WEBVTT

00:12:28.458 --> 00:12:30.726
like the Leadership Conference
on Civil Rights,

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.226
the ACLU,

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.518
NAACP, Legal Defense Fund,

00:12:34.542 --> 00:12:36.976
Indivisible, ColorOfChange.org,

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.434
these groups are going to be
fighting in the courts,

00:12:39.458 --> 00:12:40.726
fighting in Congress,

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:43.018
to try to make sure
that we have a fair outcome.

00:12:43.042 --> 00:12:46.101
Those groups could use
your help and your donations.

00:12:46.125 --> 00:12:48.101
But if it gets to the point

00:12:48.125 --> 00:12:49.684
where you feel

00:12:49.708 --> 00:12:51.934
that you have to take it to the streets,

00:12:51.958 --> 00:12:53.893
that you're going to have to go outside

00:12:53.917 --> 00:12:56.976
and demonstrate and march and protest,

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.226
please do it peacefully.